        <p>OAUTION.— The only medicine which gives immediate ease to the molt violent cough, to consumntion end asthma. 's Du. Loonex's PuLaroxiC WAlt'llS, as the shortest trial will Prove. N.f,hing else gives such a sound, rrfreshing night's rest. Their efficacy in all disorders of the breath and lungs Is wonderful . In hysterical and , heart complaints they ere unfailing, and in rheumatic and nervous pains they act Plie a charm " awl taste pleasantly. Sold at is. lid. and 2s, 91 per box by all druggists.—Beware of Counter: eite. Adel. (3</p>
